    "updated_at": "2022-05-04T19:22:27Z",
    "body": "It seems the intention was to allow that, per\r\n\r\n> [undefined](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-undefined) constant values in IDL are represented with the undefined token.\r\n\r\nProbably we should just make undefined a primitive type? It's certainly a primitive type in JavaScript, and I'm not sure why we'd depart.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/webidl/issues/comments/1117732388/reactions",
